      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Jacques Bernard \"Jacky\" Ickx (] ) (born 1 January 1945, in Brussels) is a Belgian former racing driver who won the 24 Hours of Le Mans six times, achieved eight wins and 25 podium finishes in Formula One, won the Can-Am Championship in 1979 and is a former winner of the Dakar Rally.",
